#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:5
msgid "How to Be Cyber Smart? – HSBC HK"
msgstr "如何變得更Cyber Smart？ - 香港滙豐"

#: frontend/templates/android-malware-safety-measures.html:13
msgid "Cyber security and fraud hub"
msgstr "網路安全及防詐騙資訊中心"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:11
msgid "How to be Cyber Smart?"
msgstr "如何變得更Cyber Smart？"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:19
msgid ""
"The internet has made our lives incredibly convenient. But for all the "
"benefits this enormous data explosion gives us, it also brings new risks."
msgstr "互聯網帶來的數據大爆炸，雖然讓我們的生活更加方便，但也為我們帶來新的風險。"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:20
msgid ""
"Are Hongkongers able to handle and avoid threats like identity theft, "
"online scams, account hacks or ransomware?"
msgstr "對於互聯網帶來的身份盜竊、網上詐騙、賬戶被盜或電腦勒索等危機，港人有能力處理和防範嗎？"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:21
msgid ""
"We wanted to know. So in February 2020, we surveyed more than 1,000 Hong "
"Kong residents – both HSBC customers and non-customers – to see how "
"\"Cyber Smart\" they are."
msgstr "我們很好奇，所以我們在2020年2月進行調查，訪問超過1,000名香港居民（包括滙豐和非滙豐客戶），了解他們有多「Cyber Smart」。"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:22
msgid ""
"We plotted their results on our Cyber Security Index, which we developed "
"with a well-known market research company."
msgstr "我們又與一家知名市場調研公司合作開發網絡安全指數，顯示調查結果。"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:26
msgid "The Index is comprised of 3 key pillars:"
msgstr "網絡安全指數由三大關鍵指標組成："

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:28
msgid "Knowledge"
msgstr "知識"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:28
msgid ""
" – Awareness of threats as well as steps to defend and protect against "
"them"
msgstr " - 對網絡威脅和防範措施的認知"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:29
msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "行為"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:29
msgid ""
" – How a person uses technology, and how they use technology to protect "
"themselves"
msgstr " - 如何使用科技，以及如何用科技保護自己"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:30
msgid "Attitude"
msgstr "態度"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:30
msgid ""
" – How much priority a person places on staying up to date on threats, or"
" the importance they place on security precautions"
msgstr " - 有多關注最新的網絡威脅，或者有多重視保安措施"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:35
msgid "Let's look at the results."
msgstr "現在，來了解一下調查結果吧。"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:37
#, python-format
msgid "56%% of people in HK encountered scams"
msgstr "56%%港人曾經歷網上騙案"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:38
#, python-format
msgid "29%% of those people lost money, HKD2,811 on average"
msgstr "當中29%%港人蒙受金錢損失，人均損失港幣2,811元"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:43
msgid "What it takes to be \"Cyber Smart\""
msgstr "怎樣才算「Cyber Smart」"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:44
msgid ""
"To get a Cyber Smart rating, respondents had to score 80 or above in all "
"three sections of the survey. These scores show that they are more "
"conscious of different online scams and are willing to learn more about "
"the latest cybersecurity tips. They take more preventive measures against"
" cyber attacks, as well as try their best to avoid potentially risky "
"behaviours."
msgstr ""
"受訪者必須在全部三個範疇中取得80分或以上，才可以達到「Cyber "
"Smart」等級。這個等級代表他們對各種網上詐騙較為警惕，亦願意了解更多最新的網絡安全秘訣，同時會對網絡攻擊採取更多防範措施，盡力避免做出可能會對安全構成風險的行為。"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:45
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Only 8.5%% of the people in our survey received a Cyber Smart rating. What"
" did most of them get wrong? How could they have done better?"
msgstr "但是，只有8.5%%的受訪者可以歸為「Cyber Smart」。到底香港人最常犯的錯誤是甚麼？他們有甚麼可以改善的地方？"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:46
msgid "Here are some of the most common mistakes:"
msgstr "來看一下他們最常犯的錯誤："

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:48
msgid "Mistake 1:"
msgstr "錯誤一："

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:48
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Using the same password for multiple apps and sites. 66%% of respondents "
"said they did this."
msgstr "為不同應用程式和網站設定同一密碼。66%%受訪者表示曾犯這個錯誤。"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:48
#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:49
#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:50
#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:51
#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:52
msgid "Solution:"
msgstr "解決方法："

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:48
msgid ""
"Use a unique password for your online banking. Change it every 3 months "
"(at least). Don't write it down on a piece of paper and never share it "
"with anyone."
msgstr "為網上理財設定獨一無二的密碼，並且至少每三個月更改一次。但記得不要寫下密碼，也不要向任何人透露。"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:49
msgid "Mistake 2:"
msgstr "錯誤二："

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:49
msgid "Not using all the security at your disposal."
msgstr "沒有善用保安工具。"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:49
msgid ""
"Make sure you have anti-virus software installed on your devices. Use "
"2-factor identification and biometric identification to make logging on "
"quick and secure. Activate push notifications that will alert you to any "
"unexpected transactions from your account."
msgstr "除了在所有裝置安裝防毒軟件外，您也可以用雙重認證及生物識別認證等方法，安全快捷地登入戶口。您亦應啟用推送通知，在戶口出現預料之外的交易時提醒您，確保資金安全。"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:50
msgid "Mistake 3:"
msgstr "錯誤三："

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:50
msgid "Not staying up to date."
msgstr "沒有定期更新。"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:50
msgid ""
"Update your device operating systems, browsers, apps and antivirus "
"software regularly. Or, set them to auto-update so you'll always have the"
" latest levels of security."
msgstr "定期更新裝置運作系統、瀏覽器、應用程式和防毒軟件，或者開啟自動更新功能，隨時獲得最新的安全防護。"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:51
msgid "Mistake 4:"
msgstr "錯誤四："

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:51
msgid "Banking on public Wi-Fi using public devices."
msgstr "以公共電子裝置並經公眾無線網絡登入網上理財。"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:51
msgid ""
"Only use trusted Wi-Fi or cell service when banking online, and only "
"trust browsers on a reliable personal device. Avoid banking on public "
"devices (e.g. public computers in cafes or libraries) and ensure your "
"home Wi-Fi is secured with a password."
msgstr "只用可信賴的無線網絡或數據網絡連接網上理財。與此同時，只信任及使用在您個人電子裝置上的瀏覽器，並避免使用公共電子裝置，如在咖啡廳和圖書館裡的電腦，並為家居無線網絡加設密碼。"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:52
msgid "Mistake 5:"
msgstr "錯誤五："

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:52
msgid "Trusting apps too much."
msgstr "過於信任應用程式。"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:52
msgid ""
"Be cautious of any app that asks for too many permissions. Be sure to "
"read the T&amp;Cs instead of just swiping to the end and accepting them."
msgstr "當應用程式要求太多權限時，您應提高警惕，並仔細閱讀條款及細則，不要隨隨便便就按下「同意」。"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:57
msgid "Cyber Smart tips to remember your password:"
msgstr "記住密碼的小秘訣："

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:59
msgid "Log on more often:"
msgstr "經常登入賬戶"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:59
msgid "Using your password regularly will help you remember it."
msgstr "定期輸入密碼，可以幫您將它牢牢記住。"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:60
msgid "Make it personal, but discrete:"
msgstr "設定和自己有關的密碼，但不要太著跡"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:60
msgid ""
"Use a combination of upper/lowercase letters, numbers, and symbols. It "
"can look like gibberish, but still have a special meaning for you."
msgstr "使用結合大小寫字母、數字和符號的密碼可能令其他人摸不著頭腦，但對您可以包含特別意思，幫您更易記住。"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:61
msgid "Use your biometrics:"
msgstr "用生物特徵登入"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:61
msgid ""
"The HSBC HK Mobile Banking app lets you log on with just a smile or a "
"touch. It's hard to forget your face or your fingerprint."
msgstr "只需簡單一按，或者一個笑容，即可輕鬆登入香港滙豐流動理財應用程式。用臉部和指紋登入，就不用苦記密碼了吧？"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:66
msgid "HSBC is your trusted partner"
msgstr "滙豐是您值得信賴的夥伴"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:67
msgid ""
"We are very proud that the survey results ranked us as Hong Kong's most "
"trusted bank*. We work hard to keep your finances secure, and to help "
"people be more aware of online risks and dangers."
msgstr "調查結果顯示，滙豐是香港最受信賴的銀行*。對此，我們深感自豪。一直以來，我們均致力確保您的資金安全，並加強市民對網絡風險和危機的認識。"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:68
msgid ""
"But we can't do it without your help. Updating your unique online banking"
" password is a great start. Ensuring that all of your personal "
"information with us is up to date is another simple but powerful tool in "
"the fight against cybercrime."
msgstr "不過，如果沒有您的配合，我們就無法成功。您可以先為網上理財設置獨特的新密碼，並向我們提供最新的個人資料，踏出網絡安全的第一步。不要少看這個步驟，它看似簡單，卻能有效防範網絡犯罪。"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:69
msgid "We'll be updating our Cyber Security Index every year."
msgstr "我們每年都會更新網絡安全指數，"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:69
msgid "We hope that articles like this, as well as our"
msgstr "希望這篇文章和"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:69
msgid "other cyber security tips"
msgstr "其他網絡安全錦囊一樣"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:69
msgid ""
", will go a long way towards helping more Hongkongers reach that Cyber "
"Smart status."
msgstr "，能幫助更多港人變得「Cyber Smart」。"

#: frontend/templates/cyber-security-index.html:70
msgid "* Statistics from HSBC Cyber Security Index 2020"
msgstr "* 數據來自滙豐網絡安全調查2020"

